  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase access to, and quality of school education, particularly basic education (grade 1-8), by providing especially for children from marginalised a group better education. We will support over 50,000 children to access primary and lower secondary education by 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
